## 2. API网关启动流程图

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([网关启动]) --> LoadConfig[加载配置文件]
    LoadConfig --> ValidateConfig{配置验证}
    ValidateConfig -->|失败| ConfigError[配置错误,启动失败]
    ValidateConfig -->|成功| InitComponents[初始化核心组件]
    
    InitComponents --> InitThreadPool[初始化线程池]
    InitThreadPool --> InitRouteManager[初始化路由管理器]
    InitRouteManager --> InitServiceDiscovery[初始化服务发现]
    InitServiceDiscovery --> InitLoadBalancer[初始化负载均衡器]
    
    InitLoadBalancer --> InitRateLimiter[初始化限流器]
    InitRateLimiter --> InitCircuitBreaker[初始化熔断器]
    InitCircuitBreaker --> InitPerformanceMonitor{初始化性能监控}
    InitPerformanceMonitor -->|失败| Warning1[记录警告,继续启动]
    InitPerformanceMonitor -->|成功| InitServiceRegistry[初始化服务注册器]
    Warning1 --> InitServiceRegistry
    
    InitServiceRegistry --> InitHTTPServer[初始化HTTP服务器]
    InitHTTPServer --> SetupRoutes[设置网关路由]
    SetupRoutes --> SetupMiddleware[设置中间件]
    
    SetupMiddleware --> SetupCORS[设置CORS中间件]
    SetupCORS --> SetupAuth[设置认证中间件]
    SetupAuth --> SetupRateLimit[设置限流中间件]
    SetupRateLimit --> SetupMonitoring[设置监控中间件]
    
    SetupMonitoring --> StartHTTPServer{启动HTTP服务器}
    StartHTTPServer -->|失败| StartError[启动失败]
    StartHTTPServer -->|成功| RegisterGatewayRoutes[注册网关管理API]
    
    RegisterGatewayRoutes --> RegisterServiceDiscovery[注册服务发现API]
    RegisterServiceDiscovery --> SetupAPIForwarding[设置API转发路由]
    SetupAPIForwarding --> EnableDynamicRouting[启用动态路由]
    
    EnableDynamicRouting --> StartServiceDiscovery{启动服务发现}
    StartServiceDiscovery -->|失败| Warning2[记录警告,继续运行]
    StartServiceDiscovery -->|成功| StartHealthCheck[启动健康检查]
    Warning2 --> StartHealthCheck
    
    StartHealthCheck --> StartPerformanceMonitor[启动性能监控]
    StartPerformanceMonitor --> GatewayReady[网关启动完成]
    
    GatewayReady --> WaitingForServices[等待微服务注册]
    WaitingForServices --> Running[网关运行中<br/>处理请求和管理服务]
    
    %% 错误处理
    ConfigError --> Exit[退出程序]
    StartError --> Exit
    
